| Q70 | 0.160000 | 34.667 (416) | 1.211339048707730e12 | 61,850.578574 | 19,584,926.715867 | 1,165 |
| Q60 | 0.150833 | 44.250 (531) | 1.293717071911659e12 | 70,949.909194 | 18,234,231.539077 | 1,170 |
