At the first measured boundary, parallelism has essentially no slowdown: raw reached 100 episodes in 198.45 s and z-in-place in 200.42 s. Their live peaks are 1.55 and 1.64 GiB respectively (about 3.2 GiB combined), safely under the 5 GB cap. I’ll report the next material milestone rather than narrating empty polling intervals.
